====== TP-Link TL-WR902AC (AC750) v1 ======

TP-Link TL-WR902AC v1 is a pocket-size, dual-band (AC750), successor of [[toh:tp-link:tl-mr3020|TL-MR3020]] (both devices use very similar enclosure, in same size). New device is based on Qualcomm QCA9531 v2 + QCA9887.

